evil-meshtastic-firmware
========================

This is a MODIFIED version of Meshtastic firmware.

Upstream:  https://github.com/meshtastic/firmware
Base:      Meshtastic firmware release v2.7.15
Modified:  2026

The modifications add offensive security-research features (an "evil node")
for a DEF CON Ham Radio Village talk. Modified and added files include:

  src/mesh/EvilNode.{cpp,h}
  src/mesh/EvilCtrlModule.{cpp,h}
  src/graphics/draw/EvilStatusRenderer.{cpp,h}
  src/mesh/generated/meshtastic/evil_control.pb.{cpp,h}
  hooks in src/mesh/Router.cpp, src/mesh/NextHopRouter.cpp,
    src/mesh/MeshService.cpp, src/graphics/Screen.cpp
  evil build environments in variants/**/platformio.ini

